{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c284d0304a49ac4aa8303b2d7c5f1ddc0a75afd7f7cac9ea7c1ae7bb3a00bb6b", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\n制服に着替えた真は、なにやら考え事をしている……）", "zh": "（照片杂志《偶像写真！！》拍摄日。真换上制服后，似乎正在思考什么……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "4d7943a08ab766c1cb12cf7eab326016871ec83ed70b2f4e6a01481b97a13a59", "ja": "うーん……やっぱり、パンをくわえながら\n曲がり角でぶつかるほうがいいかな。", "zh": "嗯……果然还是叼着面包，在拐角处撞上比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "e6301a011a88132d524d28b5905b35012657c52a75adf31b48e4ab157fe995e5", "ja": "あ、転校生に助けられる女の子、みたいなのも\nいいかも！　{$P$}はどう思います？", "zh": "啊，像是被转校生救下的女孩子之类的，也不错呢！{$P$}觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1003_p", "source_sha256": "be1cddf8ca3c12d69c64010ae04cd061574b2e81176530662763be753b38b587", "ja": "そうだな……。\nとりあえず、何の話だ？", "zh": "是啊……\n总之，你们在聊什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "b07e66d9d339edad68494e8b8f93a3a20e53e17d6ee3d35c58a5e690dc2b5085", "ja": "撮影のテーマの話です。カメラマンさんが、\n思わずときめくような写真にしたいって♪", "zh": "是在说拍摄的主题。摄影师说，想拍出让人忍不住心动的照片♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "d824d77ec4fb8e7201446360b99d471e413c2542ada6349d178d2eda84f692bf", "ja": "ときめくといえば、やっぱり少女漫画ですよね！\n恋の予感、憧れ、キラキラ、ドキドキ……くぅ～！！", "zh": "说到心动，果然还是少女漫画最棒了！\n恋爱的预感、憧憬、闪闪发光、怦然心动……呜～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1006_p", "source_sha256": "09540ffcc104d0e2d98a48951b2caeaaa9f4fcf0457bf84f4509c7c34597e99a", "ja": "なるほど。少女漫画っぽい事を\n撮影でやりたいわけだな？", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，你想在拍摄中展现少女漫画风格的内容吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "b7b3f7a7d1d73c1d5c5ee5ac6c273cda44ab68b8740562bd2ab31806ecb35f73", "ja": "はい！　少女漫画全開の、誰もがときめく\nカワイイ写真にしてみせます！", "zh": "没错！我会拍出少女漫画风十足、让所有人都心动的可爱照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9df677d9b2b8fb0d24c47b62185c3d001458d880578a8d28065a3dd7938c22aa", "ja": "うん、気合いを入れるのはいいんだけど……\nあんまり入れすぎないようにな？", "zh": "嗯，鼓足干劲是好事，但是……\n可别太用力过头了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "5cb8d4f1cd0dcf0e5624340c847bc08ef501b1050c229d5b73e7e898d023291d", "ja": "え？　ダメですか、少女漫画？", "zh": "诶？少女漫画不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3235c10cdbe9ed8bc88430b8d482b4f6344f64c4ed17277a151ea9f1dbed695d", "ja": "いや、いいんだけど。ファンはきっと真の学校生活とか\nそういう自然な方向も見たいんじゃないかと思って。", "zh": "不是，倒也没关系。只是我觉得，粉丝们肯定也想看看真在学校里的生活，或者类似这样自然的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "7cd05f48e5d078326cd4c04065893cfcdbe83f0cd6261ad68327b9a9b13a0362", "ja": "ボクの学校生活か……。うーん、でもなぁ。\n{$P$}、知ってます？", "zh": "我的校园生活啊……嗯，不过嘛。{$P$}，您知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1645ec4444fd76515603b77588a16ab6b522f9ba8d16715a0ddf72b2cd3b6c79", "ja": "え、何をだ？", "zh": "呃，你说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "92e2a5151da310b77e5fcac01bbdadb09d4fb1de296c2937cb9d8a7e038fa526", "ja": "女子校の実態です。みんな結構ガサツなんですよね。\n男子の目がないからかもしれないですけど……。", "zh": "女子学校的真实情况。大家其实都挺大大咧咧的。\n也许是因为没有男生的目光吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "fd573877401f55da0ea0c7f02aae4d72a8a62ad916a97e6e254e227f9eb19a63", "ja": "スカートバタバタして煽いだり、大きな声で笑ったり。\nあんまり、ときめかないと思いますよ？", "zh": "把裙子扇得呼呼作响，还大声笑个不停。\n我觉得，这样可不太让人心动吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5fa2cf57481fa2df2aeb926019b441b912ae5352ed62a6c88b1dd379cbda29bd", "ja": "なるほど。でも、楽しいなら、\nそれでいいと思うよ。", "zh": "原来如此。不过，只要开心，\n那样就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "47ff69b6cc193159d5343ee500c895e3d3fd7f51e2c88c925a70ee03ff763364", "ja": "え、そうですか？\n楽しいことは楽しいですけど……？", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？\n开心确实是开心啦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7d57efd9916d8ea8db7b91f7e634194d4c0196a04f7792bfb99ab01ab5dbea46", "ja": "男子の目を気にしないで、心から笑ったり、\nはしゃいだりしてるんだろ？　だったら大丈夫！", "zh": "别在意男孩子们的目光，发自内心地欢笑、尽情玩闹，不是吗？那就没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1018_p", "source_sha256": "993ff2262801728ef52e91f5f5c4683f46d363f30bb4f68bc4b5f74474d6ebf1", "ja": "それはきっと、ありのままの真の、本当の、\n素敵な笑顔だ。みんな、ときめいてくれるよ！", "zh": "那一定是毫不掩饰的真，发自内心的、最棒的笑容。大家都会为之心动的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "67c5c5e05026dc3aa304cf89d414489826595c1c7294b3c5d6916fe9eba3536d", "ja": "あ、なんか、どうしよう。\n困ったな……。", "zh": "啊，总觉得……该怎么办呢。\n真伤脑筋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f2f272145a64e7a911e11c1059c7218b20740fa1db6e806b608e6d8c7e44932b", "ja": "あれ？　やっぱりピンと来ないか？", "zh": "咦？果然还是没什么感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "bda699b0fbe7648ed4615d5491c7209126cb98581552710330b05f988b10bc5a", "ja": "いえ、来ました！　来たんですけど、その……。", "zh": "不，有感觉了！虽然是有感觉了，不过那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0123_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "0487d9af0e21b58cb6b6d81fff5322fada64eef3bcb7dc80da2d23581878e0d5", "ja": "なんだか、ボクがときめいちゃったみたいで。\n……えへへ♪", "zh": "总觉得，好像是我心动了。\n……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
